<title>RUSSIA: Rouble falls to 5,340 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble falls to 5,340 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 5,340.00 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,326.50 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Aug 26		  Aug 23</p>
<p> Dollar rate		  5,340.00		5,326.50</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	 10.18		    9.96</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
